  "translation": "Gomme di ile tša atamela pele ga Elazara moperisita, le pele ga Yehoshua mora Nune, le pele ga balaodi, ba re: Yahwe o laeditše ⟨את⟩ Moshe go re fa ketekelo gare ga baena ba rena; gomme ⟨a⟩ ba file, ka molomo wa Yahwe, ketekelo gare ga baena ba ntate ⟨ya bona⟩.",
